item.description:
Returns the full conversation object including all embedded messages (ordered by createdAt asc).

Messages in data.messages are created by the WebSocket send_message event. If the array is empty, send a message via WebSocket first:
  1. Connect ws://localhost:8080 with Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
  2. Emit join_conversation: { conversationId }
  3. Emit send_message: { conversationId, content: 'Xin chào, tôi cần tư vấn.' }

Also saves the first messageId for the mark-as-read test (08.07).
